    "title": "Speaking and interaction practice",
    "subtitle": "The intention was different · 1 · preparation 1",
    "context": "Use this subset of the feelings vocabulary and constructions in a short self-contained situation, preparing for U5-24. Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to distinguish an expressed attitude from an assumption and repair a misunderstanding.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U5-24-P01-speak-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Explain the situation",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U5-24-P01-speak-draft",
            "kind": "production",
            "response": "spoken",
            "prompt": "The intention was different · 1 · preparation 1: Present a supported viewpoint about the decision in this account. Refer to a concrete source detail, acknowledge a plausible alternative, and qualify what the evidence cannot establish.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "比赛结果出来后，朋友一直沉默，没有像平时一样说笑。我猜他没拿到第一名，心里难过，就马上安慰他，说以后还可以再参加。\n\n朋友没有回答，我又说下次比赛会更好。他这才轻轻地告诉我，自己担心的不是比赛结果，而是借来的相机找不到了，不知道该怎么办。\n\n我这才明白，刚才说的内容完全没有解决他真正担心的事情。我先停下来，听他说明最后一次用相机是什么时候，在哪里放过。\n\n我们先问清楚最后用相机的地方，再按他回忆的顺序找，终于在放衣服的房间里找到了。他笑了，说刚才怕别人觉得他不认真，所以一直没敢说。\n\n回去时，他感谢我陪着找，却没有说需要我接着说什么。我也说自己刚才太急，只看见他没有说话，就把原因想好了。\n\n这件事以后，我仍然愿意关心朋友，但会先问他是否想说说发生了什么。想帮助朋友很好，先听清楚对方的担心，才知道应该怎样帮助。",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Take your speaking turn",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed speaking practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "A concrete source detail supports my position."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "I represented the alternative fairly and retained an important qualification."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sequential": true
      }
